              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono sisiindu siboofu sili mbo limenya lienywe likhoya libe nga Elomo Endayi eya Kristo ne yenya, nio ese nakhanyala khukhwicha khumubona enywe namwe tawe, khaulile ndi mwemile bulayi mu sifuno silala, lundi mulikho mupanila lisuubila ne Lomo Endayi ne liliekoomba lilala liong'ene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukharia basiku benywe tawe, ba banyindaafu buli lwoosi, mala lino lilabekesia lili balakhilwa ne enywe mulabaula sikila Wele niye omuelesianga enywe bukhili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enywe mwaelesibwa bubweyaangu bwe khukholela Kristo, ne se khuli khusuubila mu niye khwong'ene tawe, ne kakhali akhaba khu khupisibwa siibi sikila niye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.29",
